# Executive Operations Dashboard

> [!NOTE]
> Powered by Zolto Phase 8 Spatial Layout Engine (`@layout`, `@grid`, `@flex`, `@chart`, `@vector`).

---

@layout width=100% padding=24 gap=20 theme="dark"
  @header
    ## Infrastructure Overview
  @/header

  @grid columns=12 gap=16
    @cell span=3
      @card title="Active Nodes" variant="success"
        1,024 Clusters Online
      @/card
    @/cell
    @cell span=3
      @card title="Global Traffic" variant="info"
        4.2 TB/s Ingress
      @/card
    @/cell
    @cell span=3
      @card title="Error Rate" variant="default"
        0.0012% HTTP 5xx
      @/card
    @/cell
    @cell span=3
      @card title="Avg Latency" variant="success"
        14.2 ms Worldwide
      @/card
    @/cell

    @cell span=8
      ### Traffic Throughput
      @chart spline title="Ingress vs Egress (GB/s)"
      labels: 00:00 04:00 08:00 12:00 16:00 20:00
      data: 210 180 450 890 920 640
      @/chart
    @/cell

    @cell span=4
      ### Cluster Topology
      @diagram flowchart
      node API [label="API Gateway"]
      node Auth [label="Auth Service"]
      node DB [label="Primary DB"]
      API -> Auth -> DB
      @/diagram
    @/cell
  @/grid

  @footer
    Zolto v8.0.0 · Zero External Dependencies
  @/footer
@/layout
